#: scenario5:scenario5_75C07A29_C01E_4B8A_89D6_B8CBC2D40686
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 886cbc453b00d45cbb3430a124a5a4984881499772062eb9164e585f80f21f2d
#. default-sha256: 6eca6fe7f477e387a2cb1e4133ca2be0e571f19af286128d4f18ab5e1ed612d6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_75C07A29_C01E_4B8A_89D6_B8CBC2D40686"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Giselle didn’t recover for some time "
"after I managed to get her inside. ⟪k:11⟫Unsure what else I could do for her,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Giselle não se recuperou por algum tempo "
"depois que consegui colocá-la para dentro. ⟪k:11⟫Sem saber o que mais eu poderia fazer por ela,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5E3A5592_8060_41EB_BC69_E08FE5260F40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11ab26ac68f25f9346ede41a63a5cfa13593d2150f90c00727cdf3ee4f45e319
#. default-sha256: fd8e33ae918f5853e4dd2abe588a323f9c114b3e07957299b0c186c4c84534f4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5E3A5592_8060_41EB_BC69_E08FE5260F40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had her sit before the fireplace and waited in silence as she sobbed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫a fiz sentar diante da lareira e esperei em silêncio enquanto ela soluçava."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C5F59D36_BBD5_4935_BED2_38B5B1977943
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e20ca2e80726b2cdd1b5932d7947342f99419b87af247195e97c7e4b1a483cd7
#. default-sha256: 53c8932646080bf421ab59790e3f66d916139b36a7c5a40ce3b75bf0f5546fbf
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C5F59D36_BBD5_4935_BED2_38B5B1977943"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had no idea what one was supposed to say to someone who was crying."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu não tinha ideia do que se deveria dizer a alguém que estava chorando."

#: scenario5:scenario5_133846E6_A6C0_4A08_9035_F8D79CDAA20A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66e0e3495e09c981a6e09ae7150d67e9dffe4633273e29d820975a15b581b1d3
#. default-sha256: 2d17087b5d6566495e100b94fe12265c5ea28cb7df9291ae42ded6fa33bfc55c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_133846E6_A6C0_4A08_9035_F8D79CDAA20A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Was it normal to offer them a warm drink? ⟪k:1⟫I didn’t know."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era normal oferecer-lhes uma bebida quente? ⟪k:1⟫Eu não sabia."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A50EF3F8_025D_4A44_B855_E041CE1DBF29
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b3a221a56de6b5d3c74d9d7313a9a97955dfa30ac11232718292f5e61f57bbd
#. default-sha256: eb54e01ea0dc4d9db581883fe56d26875017d8b5cc7a740402e84a16609727f7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A50EF3F8_025D_4A44_B855_E041CE1DBF29"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I ⟪k:1⟫did⟪k:2⟫ know I needed to reflect on the things she had said outside and try to make "
"sense of them,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu ⟪k:1⟫sabia⟪k:2⟫ que precisava refletir sobre as coisas que ela havia dito lá fora e "
"tentar entendê-las,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_41884D0C_E62C_4552_9297_0CB1123236FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 929ba55dccf169379767c48628e5a4c51a4b8d543257cc1c4b5c0c8e2aad004d
#. default-sha256: b19ee3e78e3be9e385c2574d030a59def55a750108edb085f32defdefae9e184
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_41884D0C_E62C_4552_9297_0CB1123236FF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and from there, calm myself down and prepare for the conversation we were to have—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"as unpleasant as I was sure it would be."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫e a partir daí me acalmar e me preparar para a conversa que teríamos—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫tão "
"desagradável quanto eu tinha certeza que seria."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F7385662_6EF7_4B14_BBFC_FE0FF5D9D8FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15368c06a53d321a68b78f231f21b1270081afe8ccc92121560a67b51942e313
#. default-sha256: 18080d18ef07bc809f073dafdbd3d9eaf9142eaee4a1540ab479a2e4f1684072
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F7385662_6EF7_4B14_BBFC_FE0FF5D9D8FB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...A considerable amount of time later, Giselle’s sobbing drew to a stop, an oppressive "
"silence stepping in to take its place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Uma quantidade considerável de tempo depois, os soluços de Giselle pararam, um silêncio "
"opressivo entrando em seu lugar."

