#: scenario5:scenario5_3E162B84_873A_4674_91CC_E3B88D707B3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a19ba07e5ac7fe0850340aeaea0cd55d55bcbf8e6976b57eed96148cb793f3ab
