msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Could you please tell me... ⟪k:3⟫what you did at—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫no, what was done "
"to you at my family’s home,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Por favor, poderia me dizer... ⟪k:3⟫o que você fez na—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫não, o que "
"fizeram com você na casa da minha família,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C3B4E45_04D7_436C_93E2_3859E3D15729
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d9b265a1ce6e6955d158d51541f5cca319f09c2a018ffcd0914bca282cc1e90
