"you ⟪k:5⟫don’t⟪k:6⟫ find me revolting?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫That you’re willing to forgive me for that?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu sou... ⟪k:1⟫filho de Antonin. ⟪k:2⟫Seu sangue flui através de mim.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Pode dizer "
